  "details": "I'll post a YouTube link of what happened after I started up OBS. Still, I was in my community's public lobby doing onboarding for newer players when the lobby began to lag getting my frames down to around 10 to 20 and fluctuating. After this, a load sound started playing that you can see in a video, and then all the users started getting teleported to spawn. People tried to leave but kept getting teleported to spawn. During this users either left or crashed. This left only 3 open in the lobby in the end with over 30 people in the lobby before. I've noticed this happening almost every night but this is the first time I've gotten footage of it. This has been a major issue for me and my community when onboarding and helping newer users join the platform and needs to be addressed.\n\nHeres the video link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cvgsA09KcH4",
